{"title":"Wireless EB","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"z811-earbuds","title":"Z 811 Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet your all day audio companion with the best selling Z811 Earbuds giving you upto 50 Hours of Playtime, IPX5 Water Resistance with Quad Mic ENC, giving you the best in class features in a sleek flip design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Z 811\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZ811 Earbuds: Your Ultimate Audio Companion\u003cbr\u003eExperience unparalleled sound quality and comfort with the Z811 earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e: Enjoy up to 50 hours of playtime on a single charge.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCrystal-Clear Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our 13mm bass drivers deliver exceptional HD sound quality, ensuring you hear every detail of your music.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e: With Quad Mic ENC, enjoy crystal-clear calls and meetings without background noise interference.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our Bluetooth 5.3 technology ensures instant pairing with your device, so you can start listening right away.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: Get 120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes with our fast-charging technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComfortable Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e: The Z811's lightweight and ergonomic design provide a comfortable fit for all-day wear.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Construction\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our IPX5 water resistance rating ensures your earbuds can withstand sweat and light rain.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: Choose from our dual-toned soft matte rubber finish in multiple colors to match your style.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Easily activate your device's AI voice assistant with simple touch controls or voice commands.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Experience lag-free gaming with our 40ms low latency mode.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBreathing LED Lights\u003c\/strong\u003e: Add a touch of style with our breathing LED lights.\u003cbr\u003eUpgrade your audio experience today with the Z811 earbuds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Z811\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50 Hours Total Playback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Playback: 50 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFast Charging: 10min Charge = 120min Playtime Charging Port: C-type\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDriver: 13mm Audio codec: AAC, SBC High Fidelity Acosutics\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBT Version: 5.3 BT supported profile: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP Compatibility: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdded Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperbass™ Technology, 13mm Drivers | SBC, AAC Codec Supported\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Z811\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Z811 is the most reliable choice for your earbuds in the industry with a sleek design packed with audio leading features. It’s IPX5 Water Resistance ensures that your in-ear companion stays with you in every terrain with a battery life that lasts as long as you do!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"White","offer_id":46203584643350,"sku":"18544","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":46203584381206,"sku":"18510","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/811-white-1.webp?v=1733300591"},{"product_id":"quantum-earbuds","title":"Quantum Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eImmerse yourself in a new sensation of Spatial Audio Beats with Fawad Khan’s Quantum Earbuds. Equipped with ANC Technology, Quad Mic ENC, and Instant Pairing, the Quantum Earbuds offer a 70-hour battery life. Designed with a two-toned gradient Flybird Design, these earbuds enhance every decibel, delivering crystal clear audio quality for an unmatched listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Quantum\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActive ANC Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e70 Hour Battery Life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActive Flybird Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Aurora Green","offer_id":47560667922710,"sku":"19678","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blazing Red","offer_id":48744573894934,"sku":"23496","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47560668021014,"sku":"19680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Glacier Blue","offer_id":47560667988246,"sku":"19679","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Calm Beige","offer_id":47560667955478,"sku":"19681","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Zero_Quantum_Green_01_1.webp?v=1720007567"},{"product_id":"pulse-earbuds","title":"Pulse Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003ePULSE Earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Blue Coffee","offer_id":47634128634134,"sku":"19657","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Champagne","offer_id":47633947623702,"sku":"20163","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ivory White","offer_id":47633947590934,"sku":"19656","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Warm Gray","offer_id":47633947656470,"sku":"19655","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gray","offer_id":47634128601366,"sku":"19659","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray Black","offer_id":47633970561302,"sku":"19658","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Zero_Pulse_01-min.png?v=1713785214"},{"product_id":"wave-earbuds","title":"Wave Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eDive deeper into the true tunes of your beat with the Wave Earbuds, offering superior noise cancellation powered by its 10MM Bass Driver. Featuring Quad Mic ENC, Low Latency Gaming Mode, and seamless Bluetooth connections for instant pairing, the Wave Earbuds are perfect for your day-to-day life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Wave:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10MM Big Bass Driver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47633617846550,"sku":"19085","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":50303940985110,"sku":"23068","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown","offer_id":47633617879318,"sku":"19086","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47633617781014,"sku":"19087","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/4_blue_20946955-541d-4b11-b046-2c569040eca9.webp?v=1786542878"},{"product_id":"astro-earbuds","title":"Astro Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eAstro Earbuds \u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAstro Earbuds deliver a superior listening experience with a sleek and stylish design. Perfect for those who demand both high performance and comfort, these earbuds are ideal for any activity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Astro Earbuds:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAstro Earbuds offer clear, immersive sound with enhanced bass and crisp highs. The built-in noise reduction allows you to enjoy your music without distractions. The ergonomic design ensures a secure and comfortable fit, while touch controls make it easy to manage your music and calls. The long-lasting battery life ensures you stay connected throughout your day, and the compact charging case provides extra power on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Astro Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDriver Size: 12mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 hours (up to 28 hours with charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Time: 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise isolation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 4g (with Case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Astro Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAstro Earbuds offer exceptional audio quality and comfort, making them the perfect choice for music enthusiasts. With features like noise reduction and extended battery life, these earbuds stand out in their category. The stylish design ensures they complement any look, making them suitable for any occasion. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a hassle-free experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":48150283911446,"sku":"18934","price":4799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":48150283944214,"sku":"18999","price":4799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mauve","offer_id":48150283976982,"sku":"19000","price":4799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Calm Beige","offer_id":48150284009750,"sku":"19340","price":4799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Untitleddesign_86.png?v=1720701403"},{"product_id":"rover-pro","title":"Rover Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the freedom in every beat with the Rover Pro’s Aerofit Design and 70-hour playtime, delivering crystal clarity of every sound with its HD audio quality and Instant Connectivity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of the Rover Pro:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e70 Hour Battery Life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAerofit Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperBass Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Matte Black","offer_id":48941158564118,"sku":"22371","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Deep Purple","offer_id":48941158596886,"sku":"22369","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Calm White","offer_id":48941158662422,"sku":"22365","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Electric Blue","offer_id":48941158531350,"sku":"22363","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Serene Blue","offer_id":48941158629654,"sku":"22367","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Angle-2_2.webp?v=1775900956"},{"product_id":"flash-earbuds","title":"Flash Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eNever miss a beat and play life to its fullest with the Flash Earbuds, offering a 48-hour battery life and quick charging that gives you 120 minutes of playtime with just 10 minutes of charging. Designed with a sleek Metallic Rim, the Flash Earbuds come equipped with a Quad Mic with ENC, Instant Pairing Bluetooth connection, and Low Latency Gaming Mode for uninterrupted audio experiences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Flash Earbuds:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick Charging of 10 Minutes (120 minutes of playtime)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48 Hour Battery Life on Full Charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Latency Bluetooth Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHD Sound Quality\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"White","offer_id":48701179986198,"sku":"20508","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48701170876694,"sku":"20506","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48701170909462,"sku":"20510","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Black_1_bf5ef17e-32c5-44c7-8937-a4c1ec088b4e.webp?v=1725881070"},{"product_id":"carbon-earbuds","title":"Carbon Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds with super loud sound and Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eCarbon Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover unparalleled sound quality with Carbon Earbuds. These earbuds are designed for those who seek both high-performance audio and comfort. Ideal for any activity, Carbon Earbuds deliver an outstanding listening experience whether you're on the go or at home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds provide rich, immersive sound with enhanced bass and clear treble. With built-in noise reduction, you can enjoy your music without interruption.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lightweight and ergonomic design ensures a secure and comfortable fit, while touch controls allow for easy music and call management. The long-lasting battery life ensures you stay connected longer, and the sleek charging case provides additional power for extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 hours (up to 28 hours with charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Time: 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise Cancellation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 50g (with case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Carbon Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuantum Earbuds provide exceptional sound quality and comfort, making them the perfect choice for any audio lover. With advanced features like noise cancellation and long battery life, these earbuds stand out in the market. The sleek and modern design adds a touch of style to your audio experience, making them suitable for any setting. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48768395870486,"sku":"20392","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Dark Green","offer_id":48768395903254,"sku":"20482","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Light Gray","offer_id":48768395936022,"sku":"20480","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/JX98-01.webp?v=1765806286"},{"product_id":"rover","title":"Rover Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRover Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rover Earbuds is sleekness redefined, making it the ultimate fashion-tech companion for you to have with 5 Matte Monochrome Shades, a revolutionary 70 Hour Battery, a unique flybird design for comfort designed with precision through Zero’s AeroFit technology, making it the best in terms of fashion and function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Rover Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnmatched 70 Hour Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience true wireless freedom with every beat as you live life without pausing through the Rover Pro’s unmatched 70 Hour Battery Life.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMatte Monochrome Finish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your beat and let your tech speak for you with the Rover Pro’s 5 Matte Monochrome shades, making it as much a fashion accessory as it is cutting-edge audio technology.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncredible Audio Immersion:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience high-resolution audio at every moment with 11MM HyperBass Drivers transporting you to your desired vibe.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnbeatable Battery Life with Ultra Fast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e With 70 Hour Standby Playback, your jamming sessions never end as you power up with ultra fast charging, giving you 120 mins of playback in just 10 minutes!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Rover Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Gaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Full-color touch screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eENC \u0026amp; Quad Mic:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steps, calories, various exercise modes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multiple customizable watch faces available.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Rover Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re looking for the true wireless experience to enhance the beats of life whether you’re at home, on the go or in your workspace then the Rover Pro is the must-have for every audiophile. If you’re into gaming and also binge-watching your favorite series, the Arcade Series has over 70 Hours of Playback Battery with Hyperbass Audio giving you the vibes you want in every beat.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":48945504944406,"sku":"19672","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Green","offer_id":48945504977174,"sku":"19671","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"White","offer_id":48945504911638,"sku":"19670","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":48945505173782,"sku":"19669","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/White_04.01.png?v=1720161116"},{"product_id":"thunder","title":"Thunder Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eSpark a new beat in your playlist with the Thunder Earbuds, powered by Zero’s HyperBass Technology. Featuring a sleek Aerofit Design with IPX5 Water Resistance, the Thunder Earbuds offer crystal clear audio, Quad Mic ENC, and up to 50 hours of battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Thunder:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrystal Clear Audio With HyperBass Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAerofit Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50 Hour Battery Life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":48993547256086,"sku":"19943","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Green","offer_id":48993547288854,"sku":"19944","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":48993547190550,"sku":"19941","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"White","offer_id":48993547223318,"sku":"19942","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Black_e27c0334-2871-4fd6-af07-6ae12a8eb161.webp?v=1725873110"},{"product_id":"wave-pro","title":"Wave Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"53542514-04a7-447c-b6a1-c81cd58127bc\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro Earbuds represent the next generation of in-ear audio, delivering an unparalleled HD sound experience with over 100 hours of playback time. As the industry's first powerhouse earbuds with such longevity, Wave Pro stands out with 5 dual-toned, soft matte finishes, seamlessly blending superior audio performance with cutting-edge style that perfectly matches your fashion sense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro offers an industry-leading 100 hours of playback time, powered by 13mm Bass Drivers that deliver crystal-clear HD sound. Equipped with Quad Mic ENC, the earbuds ensure premium call quality and effective noise cancellation, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Bluetooth 5.3 and Insta-Pair technology, the Wave Pro connects to your device instantly, and a quick charge of just 10 minutes provides 120 minutes of playback. The lightweight, ergonomic design with rounded monochrome tips ensures all-day comfort, while the soft matte, dual-tone rubber finish adds both style and enhanced grip for easy carrying.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro also features AI Voice Assistant with touch controls for seamless hands-free operation. Whether you're using \"Hey Siri\" for iOS or \"Ok Google\" for Android, activating your assistant is as easy as tapping or holding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlayback Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDrivers\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm Hyperbass™ Tech\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLatency\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 10-minute charge = 120 minutes of playtime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/strong\u003e: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Size\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs\u003c\/strong\u003e: AAC, SBC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Fidelity Acoustics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSupported Profiles\u003c\/strong\u003e: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/strong\u003e: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHyperbass™ Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Wave Pro?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro merges fast fashion with disruptive technology. Boasting the largest battery capacity in the industry, superior sound quality, and a sleek dual-tone matte finish, these earbuds are a perfect balance of performance and style. The Wave Pro isn’t just an accessory—it’s a reliable companion that elevates both your listening experience and your sense of style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Orange Black","offer_id":49286916931862,"sku":"22481","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Gray","offer_id":49286910017814,"sku":"22539","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lilic Gray","offer_id":49286909985046,"sku":"22615","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49286909952278,"sku":"22613","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":50027537662230,"sku":"23070","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Ecommerce-Image-1.webp?v=1729196999"},{"product_id":"wave-neo-earbuds","title":"Wave Neo Earbuds","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"53542514-04a7-447c-b6a1-c81cd58127bc\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet the Wave Neo Earbuds, designed to blend advanced technology with stylish looks. They come in Moon Brown, Forest Green, Steel Gray, and Lilac Purple colors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Neo Earbuds deliver great sound quality using Bluetooth 5.3. They support AAC and SBC audio formats and have dual microphones for clear calls. They're also built to resist water splashes (IPX4) and feature easy touch controls for quick pairing and voice assistant access. Gamers will appreciate their low delay of just 45 milliseconds. Plus, they offer up to 20 hours of total playtime with the charging case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize and Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds: 33.5 x 21.3 x 23.5mm, Charging Case: 58.1 x 47.99 x 30.00mm, Weight: 38.2g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds: 40mAh, Charging Case: 360mAh, Charging Time: 1.5 hours, Total Play Time: 20 hours, Playing Time: 6 hours, Standby Time: 40 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWireless Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth 5.3, Range: 15 meters, Supports: HFP V1.5, A2DP V1.3, AVRCP V1.3, HID V1.0, Auto Pairing: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFunctionality:\u003c\/strong\u003e Touch Control (with 7 sensitivity levels), Dual Silicon Microphone ENC for noise reduction, Audio Formats: SBC, AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Wave Neo:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Neo Earbuds are all about great sound, stylish design, and user-friendly features. They're perfect for everyday listening or getting into your favorite games with minimal delay. With their sleek look and easy touch controls, these earbuds fit seamlessly into modern lifestyles, offering both performance and style in one package.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49492874166550,"sku":"22432","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49492874232086,"sku":"22641","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Steel Gray","offer_id":49492874199318,"sku":"22639","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Lilac Purple","offer_id":49492874264854,"sku":"22640","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/7_2.webp?v=1736756569"},{"product_id":"vibe-earbuds","title":"Vibe Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eEarbuds Specification\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Black, white, green, blue\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Form: In-ear\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAudio\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudible Unit: F11\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency: 20Hz-20,000Hz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpedance: 32Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitivity: 110±3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudio Decoding: SBC\/AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Platform: 5.4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Distance: ＞10m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnection Way: Bluetooth link\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Specification: JL6973D4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Protocol: HSP\/HFP\/A2DP\/AVRCP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto Pairing: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaster Slave Switch: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eBattery Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Input Type: Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBox Input Power: 5V-300mA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBox Output Power: 5V-140mA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Batteries Capacity: 40mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case Battery Capacity: 450mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Play Time: 40h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaying Time: 7h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 300 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: Headphones 45 minutes, charging case 1.5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003ePhysical Specification\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Proof: IPX4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWake up Siri \/ Google Assistant: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitive Touch: Built-in touchpad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBoost: The battery controls the elevating voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurn off: Put in the charging compartment, shut down and enter the charging state\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlay\/Pause: In the music state, double-click any headset button once\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSkip Back: Long press left ear for 2 seconds to start\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSkip Forward: Long press the right ear for 2 seconds for the next song\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume+: Click the right ear to add\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume-: Click the left ear to subtract\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiri \/ Google Assistant: Three touches on either side of the headset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Latency MS: 120ms\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHang up: In call status, double-click any headset to hang up\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnswer Call: When an incoming call comes in, click any headset to answer the call\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReject Call: Press and hold for about 2 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFactory Reset: In the off state, hold down the touch button for 8 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49548913312022,"sku":"22649","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":49548913279254,"sku":"23234","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Storm Green","offer_id":49548913213718,"sku":"23233","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49548913246486,"sku":"23232","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Vibe_4_5db79883-9794-4d19-9fa6-f75dcb7ceb3c.webp?v=1734557297"},{"product_id":"atom-pro","title":"Atom Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eAtom Pro Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Atom Pro Earbuds, your ultimate companion for premium sound and seamless connectivity. Designed with the latest technology, these earbuds provide crystal-clear audio, long-lasting battery life, and a perfect fit for all your listening needs. Whether you're working out, traveling, or just enjoying music, Atom Pro Earbuds deliver an unparalleled listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrue Wireless Stereo (TWS):\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy high-quality audio with dual microphones and clear sound.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Bluetooth Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth 5.4 with a 10-meter range, Auto Pairing, and Hyper Sync.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40 hours of total playtime, with 6 hours of continuous playback and 40 hours of standby time.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 rating, making the earbuds resistant to sweat and splashes during workouts and outdoor activities.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simple touch controls for volume, playback, and voice assistant activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50-60ms latency for a smooth, lag-free audio experience, ideal for gaming.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e One-click button for switching to low-latency mode for immersive gaming.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio:\u003c\/strong\u003e Audible Unit Φ6, SBC Audio Decoding\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth V5.4, 10m distance, A2DP 1.4, AVCTP 1.4, and more\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earphone Battery: 40mAh, Charging Case Battery: 400mAh, Total Play Time: 30 hours, Standby Time: 40 hours, Charging Time: 1 hour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earphone Dimensions: 20.2 x 17.1 x 24.9 mm, Charging Case: 51.6 x 47.3 x 29.9 mm, Weight: 40.35g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Voice Assistant Activation (Siri\/Google Assistant), Touch Controls, Volume Control, Game Mode, Low Latency Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Atom Pro Earbuds:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Atom Pro Earbuds are designed for those who demand the best in sound, performance, and convenience. With advanced features like Auto Pairing, waterproof design, and long battery life, these earbuds are perfect for every occasion. Whether you're exercising, commuting, or enjoying your favorite music, Atom Pro Earbuds bring high-quality audio and seamless connectivity to your ears, all in a compact, stylish package.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Snow White","offer_id":49646333395222,"sku":"22696","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49646333362454,"sku":"22693","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Space Blue","offer_id":49646333427990,"sku":"22698","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"True Blue","offer_id":49646333460758,"sku":"22695","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"True Purple","offer_id":49646333493526,"sku":"22700","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/AtomPro_5.webp?v=1736865384"},{"product_id":"display-earbuds","title":"Display Earbuds","description":"\u003ch3\u003eDisplay Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine cutting-edge technology with sleek design, offering superior sound, unmatched comfort, and innovative smart features. Whether you’re looking to elevate your music, calls, or gaming experience, these earbuds are designed to meet every need, offering the ultimate in wireless freedom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Design Meets Everyday Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e: Available in four stunning colors—Black, Blue, Green, and Champagne. Designed for a snug and secure fit, offering unmatched comfort even during extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Sound Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding with a quad-microphone ENC system for premium sound quality in music and calls, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Smart Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Built into the charging case for easy browsing, managing, and customizing settings. Select wallpapers, music, set timers, and more on a single screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnboard Storage\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 minutes of onboard audio storage allows you to enjoy your favorite tracks anywhere, anytime, without a phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Day Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours of playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with the charging case. Fast-charging technology ensures a full charge in just 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4 with Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, and Hyper Sync technology for lag-free performance up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow-Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ultra-low latency of 50–60 ms for smooth and responsive gameplay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e: Simple gestures for play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, activate Siri\/Google Assistant, and enter Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for Your Active Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4 water resistance rating for workouts, light rain, or everyday adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Black, Blue, Green, Champagne.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding, quad-microphone ENC system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4, Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, Hyper Sync technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Settings customization, battery status check, wallpaper selection, music browsing, timers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control\u003c\/strong\u003e: Play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, Siri\/Google Assistant activation, Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Rating\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Accessories\u003c\/strong\u003e: Display Earbuds, charging case with interactive smart screen, custom-fit eartips, USB charging cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Zero Lifestyle Display Earbuds?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Display Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine premium performance with cutting-edge features and effortless style. Offering all-day comfort, hassle-free pairing, low-latency gaming, and a customizable smart screen, these earbuds are designed to enhance every moment of your day. Whether you’re streaming, gaming, or enjoying music on the go without your phone, the Display Earbuds provide the ultimate in wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Metallic Black","offer_id":49791717409046,"sku":"23206","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic White","offer_id":49791608783126,"sku":"23204","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Blue","offer_id":49791608717590,"sku":"23200","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Green","offer_id":49791608684822,"sku":"23198","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic Beige","offer_id":49791608750358,"sku":"23202","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/brown.webp?v=1741777839"},{"product_id":"flair-earbuds","title":"Flair Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eIntroducing the FLAIR Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFLAIR earbuds redefine your wireless audio experience by combining advanced technology, durable design, and exceptional sound. These earbuds cater to all your daily needs—from immersive music to seamless connectivity and lasting comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"features\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of FLAIR Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Practical Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black, these lightweight earbuds (35g total weight) are designed for a snug fit. Compact dimensions ensure easy portability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy \u003cstrong\u003e7 hours of playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e on a single charge and an impressive \u003cstrong\u003e35 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the charging case. A fast-charging time of just \u003cstrong\u003e45 minutes for earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures you never miss a beat.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExceptional Sound Clarity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features high-definition audio decoding (SBC\/AAC), ENC for noise reduction, and in-ear form for a premium listening experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLow-Latency Gaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e60ms ultra-low latency\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures smooth and immersive gameplay for gamers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offers seamless wireless connectivity up to \u003cstrong\u003e10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e with auto-pairing and master-slave switch features for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Double-tap any earbud.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSkip Tracks:\u003c\/strong\u003e Three taps on the left for previous or right for next track.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVolume:\u003c\/strong\u003e Click left for decrease and right for increase.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivate Siri\/Google Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Four taps on the right earbud.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Press and hold either earbud for 2 seconds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer\/Reject Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simple double-tap or 2-second hold, respectively.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for Durability:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e makes these earbuds ideal for workouts or light rain.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifications\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of FLAIR Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds - 31.0 x 22.0 x 22.6mm, Charging Case - 52.5 x 43.5 x 26.5mm.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mAh (earbuds), 350mAh (charging case).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Input:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C, DC5V 75mAh.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio:\u003c\/strong\u003e Frequency Range - 20Hz–20kHz, Sensitivity - 110±3, Impedance - 32Ω.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Rating:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 ensures protection against sweat and light rain.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePackaging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes USB Type-C charging cable and user manual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"why-choose\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose FLAIR Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe FLAIR earbuds offer superior sound clarity, extended battery life, and game-ready low latency, making them perfect for music lovers, gamers, and active individuals. With IPX4 water resistance, lightweight design, and a variety of smart touch controls, these earbuds bring convenience and style together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you're working out, gaming, or making calls, the FLAIR earbuds are built to elevate every aspect of your day!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Carbon Black","offer_id":49827088269590,"sku":"22684","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Calm Beige","offer_id":49827088236822,"sku":"22687","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cool Blue","offer_id":49827088302358,"sku":"22686","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49827088335126,"sku":"22685","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/carbon_black.webp?v=1770373005"},{"product_id":"striker-earbuds","title":"Striker Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleek and Dynamic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted for style and comfort, the Striker Earbuds are available in three bold color choices—Black, Green, and Camo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions of 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 48.9 g, ensuring a comfortable fit for extended use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy uninterrupted performance with a robust battery setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 27.5 hours in total, with approximately 5.5 hours of continuous playback at 70% volume.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 2 hours via a Type-C input (1W for the case, 0.5W output).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Batteries:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by Jingshan Yifan Energy Co., Ltd. with an earbud battery capacity of 35mAh and a case capacity of 400mAh.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Duration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds last about 60 days; charging case lasts up to 120 days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience effortless pairing and uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth V5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e for stable connections.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity within \u003cstrong\u003e≥10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHassle-Free Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Supports \u003cstrong\u003eautomatic pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e for an effortless user experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Low-latency performance with \u003cstrong\u003e65ms response time\u003c\/strong\u003e for immersive gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch \u0026amp; Voice Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy easy management with sensitive touch controls.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single tap on either earbud.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCall Handling:\u003c\/strong\u003e Answer with a tap, double-tap to hang up, long press (2–3 seconds) to reject.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Activation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eleft earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for Siri or Google Assistant.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eright earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for a low-latency experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tap \u003cstrong\u003efive times\u003c\/strong\u003e while pairing L \u0026amp; R, then place them in the case and remove to confirm reset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Audio Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmerse yourself in powerful sound clarity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e13mm audio drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver a frequency range of \u003cstrong\u003e20Hz–20kHz\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Sensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e111.5±3dB\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures balanced sound performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClear Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e2718 silicone microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e for superior voice capture.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI ENC Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enhances call noise reduction for crisp conversations.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Certified \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e for protection against splashes and light rain.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.9 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e About \u003cstrong\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eV5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, supports multiple protocols\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eSBC\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophone:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single MIC\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose the Striker Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for those who demand excellence, the Striker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle bring together cutting-edge technology and a modern aesthetic. Whether you're making calls, gaming, or enjoying music, these earbuds are built to elevate your lifestyle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gaming Black","offer_id":50894617641238,"sku":"24765","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Beige","offer_id":50938794901782,"sku":"24763","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50050472968470,"sku":"22916","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Beige","offer_id":50050472870166,"sku":"22942","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"